5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if past programs actually improved patient outcomes before committing more resources.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about whether the existing infrastructure can absorb a new program without seizing up.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Delays kill projects. I need to see where the bottlenecks are in our recent starts.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I am worried about who actually does the work. I want to see the staffing records to understand the real pressure on teams.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"The ledger shows the build cost, but the running costs appear later. I need to know what this budget truly covers before we commit.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, infrastructure strain is real. I want to see if past programs actually delivered measurable patient benefits before we add another.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, measurable benefits are important, but if the rooms and booking screens cannot handle the load, the program fails before it starts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, outcomes matter, but a program that collapses in year two is just expensive failure. I am checking where recent starts actually stalled.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, delays are frustrating, but I am more worried about the people. If the teams are already stretched thin, adding more work will just break them.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, the people are the engine. If the running costs are unfunded, the engine stalls. I will check the ledger to see what is truly covered.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, running costs are critical, but without proof of patient impact, we are just funding more silence. I need to see the readmission data.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Servas, the ledger is vital, but I need to know if the physical space can handle the traffic. I will check the booking system records.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, if the booking system is the choke point, I need to see the actual throughput. I will check the visit completion on the shared nursing round.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, I agree. If the booking system is the choke point, it affects everyone. I will check the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover to see the real strain.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, throughput is key. I will examine the regional fund tariffs to see if location costs are hidden in the initial figures.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial to see if patients actually stayed well.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will check rooms, parking and shuttle coverage. I need to know if the physical space can absorb the new traffic without seizing up.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the board minutes on the jointly run clinic. I need to see if the partners actually committed to the long-term support.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I will check the therapy and midwifery staffing review. I need to see if the teams are already at breaking point before we add more.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will examine the data agreements with outside surgeries. I need to see if those external costs are hidden in the initial figures.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
